                                </p>
                                <span class="font-pixel text-[8px] uppercase" style="color: #854214;">(QS. Ar-Rum: 21)</span>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Groom -->
                            <div class="sdv-card-inner text-center">
                                <span class="sdv-badge-green font-pixel text-[7px]">★ LV. 10 SOULMATE &bull; MEMPELAI PRIA ★</span>
